        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Excom VIII 20" corresp="#wit-h"><pb n="439" ed="#liebermann"/>Maledictus (-i) si(n)t uiuendo, moriendo, manducando<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="bb" target="#ExcomVIII_20.lnote.oe.bb"/>, bibendo, esuriendo<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="cc" target="#ExcomVIII_20.lnote.oe.cc"/>, sitiendo, ieiunando<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="dd" target="#ExcomVIII_20.lnote.oe.dd"/>, dormitando, dormiendo, uigilando, ambulando, stando<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="ee" target="#ExcomVIII_20.lnote.oe.ee"/>, sedendo, iacendo, operando<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="ff" target="#ExcomVIII_20.lnote.oe.ff"/>, quiescendo, mingendo, cacando, flebotomando!</ab>
        <note type="editorial">New row (October 2026): Liebermann’s text transcribed from Gesetze I p. 439 (two independent readings of the page images, differences settled against the page)</note>
